Backend .env configuration notes

Required minimum for dev:
- DB_URL=sqlite:///./app.db
- CORS_ORIGINS must include https://appetize.io (frontend preview host)
- SECRET_KEY length >= 32 chars (auto generated fallback occurs if shorter but set one for stable tokens)

Optional:
- EKYC_PROVIDER_API_KEY and EKYC_WEBHOOK_SECRET for eKYC flows (set any non-empty dev strings)

Preview:
- Backend: https://vscode-internal-23122-beta.beta01.cloud.kavia.ai:3001
- Docs:    https://vscode-internal-23122-beta.beta01.cloud.kavia.ai:3001/docs
